 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Experience and studies",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about completed studies at an institution, the standard form is **окончить** + accusative: **Я окончил университет** («I graduated from university»). A man says **окончил**; a woman says **окончила**.",
      "To say that you know a language, **владеть** takes the instrumental: **Я владею английским языком** («I speak English»). **языком** can also be left out: **Я владею английским**.",
      "**Опыт работы** = work experience; **работы** is in the genitive. To indicate duration: **Опыт работы — пять лет** («Work experience: five years»). If you have no experience: **У меня нет опыта работы**; **нет** takes the genitive.",
      "A CV (**резюме**) usually lists education, experience and languages."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Salary",
     "texto": [
      "**От** («from») and **до** («up to») take the genitive when giving the limits of a range: **зарплата от двух тысяч до трёх тысяч рублей** («salary from two to three thousand roubles»).",
      "**Вакансия** is an available job. **У вакансии есть требования** («the vacancy has requirements»); **у вакансии** takes the genitive. To ask for information in an interview, you can say **Расскажите о себе** («tell me about yourself»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
